            <div xml:id="d640">

                <pb facs="0481" n="477" sameAs="frus:frus1938v04/pg477"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">393.115 China National Aviation Company/62:
                    Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Japan</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Grew</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1938-09-16T16:00:00+09:00">September 16, 1938—4
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received September 16—6 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>604. Department’s 316, September 14, 2 p.m., China National Aviation Corporation.
                    Note was handed to the Foreign Office this afternoon. No substantive change was
                    made in the text authorized by the Department except for incorporation in the
                    first paragraph of our note of an appropriate reference to previous
                    correspondence.</p>
                <p>See also our 605, September 16, 5 p.m.<anchor n="92" xml:id="d640-f1"/></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Grew</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
